ern Spain was Europe's main silk-","y":0.10650380903317358,"w":0.40033533732096349,"x":0.5338383410565638,"h":0.020727400631325055},{"h":0.017441859892096456,"x":0.53402061561404213,"w":0.41237113952636717,"c":1,"t":"producing centre in the tenth century. By","y":0.12790697702078579},{"x":0.53402061479534046,"c":1,"y":0.14679976511503812,"t":"the thirteenth century, however, Italy had","h":0.018897909454506978,"w":0.41649485270182285},{"t":"become Europe's leader in silk production","h":0.018804790969463303,"c":1,"w":0.42706151326497399,"y":0.1634223909239696,"x":0.53389330085136011},{"t":"and export. Venetian merchants traded","y":0.1845930234205988,"h":0.015988371754420583,"w":0.39175257364908855,"c":1,"x":0.53402062029642949},{"t":"extensively in silk and encouraged silk","h":0.016147974163241319,"x":0.53402061441032778,"y":0.20346447439962367,"w":0.38969072977701824,"c":1},{"w":0.36106567382812504,"y":0.21981240774417332,"h":0.020056123671920889,"c":1,"x":0.53392296573971953,"t":"growers to settle in Italy. Even now,"},{"c":1,"h":0.015988371754420694,"w":0.39381444295247392,"y":0.23982558155632283,"t":"silk processed in the province of Como","x":0.53402061352483698},{"t":"in northern Italy enjoys an esteemed","x":0.53402061312877702,"w":0.36701032002766931,"h":0.016147974163241319,"c":1,"y":0.25866118603125487},{"c":1,"t":"reputation.","x":0.53388248239413372,"y":0.27711513921080366,"w":0.11367833455403642,"h":0.016990651541153867},{"t":"The nineteenth century and","x":0.53402061373517618,"y":0.31385789766502903,"h":0.016147974163241319,"c":1,"w":0.27835052490234369},{"x":0.53195876094500005,"y":0.33284883725757008,"w":0.40824742635091149,"c":1,"h":0.01453488361674482,"t":"industrialisation saw the downfall of the"},{"w":0.42296587626139326,"x":0.53594132406124984,"h":0.019888372191666059,"t":"European silk industry. Cheaper Japanese","y":0.34919787336769192,"c":1},{"t":"silk, trade in which was greatly facilitated","y":0.3705226071858374,"h":0.01614797416324131